# Set these as user environment variables (see README, step 2). The server reads
# them from its process environment and, on Windows, also from your user or
# system environment variables. It does not load .env files. Values that are not
# a numeric user ID or a letters-and-digits key, such as these placeholders,
# count as unset. Never commit real values.
ZOTERO_USER_ID=YOUR_USER_ID
ZOTERO_API_KEY=YOUR_API_KEY
